#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.7.0"
msgstr "v1.7.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.7.0 introduces the ``cpufreq`` module (CPU frequency / overclocking "
"control), the MicroPython :mod:`os` module, MLX thermal-sensor refresh / "
"resolution control, and initial **OpenMV Cam M7** (STM32F7) board bring-up. "
"The :func:`fir.init` signature, oversized-frame handling, and the default "
"JPEG quality changed — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v1.7.0 引入了 ``cpufreq`` 模块（CPU 频率 / 超频控制）、MicroPython 的 :mod:`os` 模块、MLX "
"热成像传感器的刷新率 / 分辨率控制，以及初步的 **OpenMV Cam M7**\\ （STM32F7）开发板适配。\\ "
":func:`fir.init` 的签名、超大帧的处理方式以及默认 JPEG 质量都发生了变化——请阅读下方的破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:20
msgid ""
"``cpufreq`` module — query / set the CPU frequency, with an overclocking "
"example."
msgstr "``cpufreq`` 模块——查询 / 设置 CPU 频率，并附带超频示例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:22
msgid ":mod:`os` module — the MicroPython :mod:`os` module is now available."
msgstr ":mod:`os` 模块——现已支持 MicroPython 的 :mod:`os` 模块。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:23
msgid ""
"**MLX thermal** — :func:`fir.init` accepts a refresh rate and ADC "
"resolution."
msgstr "**MLX 热成像** —— :func:`fir.init` 现接受刷新率和 ADC 分辨率参数。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:24
msgid "**OpenMV Cam M7** — initial STM32F7 board bring-up."
msgstr "**OpenMV Cam M7** —— 初步的 STM32F7 开发板适配。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** :func:`fir.init` is now keyword-only, oversized frames auto-"
"crop, and the default JPEG quality dropped — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**破坏性变更：** :func:`fir.init` 现在仅接受关键字参数，超大帧会自动裁剪，且默认 JPEG 质量已下调——请参阅破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:29
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:31
msgid ""
"``cpufreq`` — added the ``cpufreq`` module with ``cpufreq.get_frequency()`` "
"/ ``cpufreq.set_frequency()`` and the ``CPUFREQ_120MHZ`` / ``144`` / ``168``"
" / ``192`` / ``216MHZ`` constants, plus an ``overclocking.py`` example."
msgstr ""
"``cpufreq`` —— 新增 ``cpufreq`` 模块，提供 ``cpufreq.get_frequency()`` / "
"``cpufreq.set_frequency()`` 以及 ``CPUFREQ_120MHZ`` / ``144`` / ``168`` / "
"``192`` / ``216MHZ`` 常量，另附 ``overclocking.py`` 示例。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:35
msgid ":mod:`os` — enabled the MicroPython :mod:`os` module."
msgstr ":mod:`os` —— 启用了 MicroPython 的 :mod:`os` 模块。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:36
msgid ""
"**MLX / FIR** — :func:`fir.init` now accepts a refresh rate and ADC "
"resolution, with matching ``refresh`` / ``resolution`` controls for the MLX "
"thermal sensor."
msgstr ""
"**MLX / FIR** —— :func:`fir.init` 现在接受刷新率和 ADC 分辨率参数，并为 MLX 热成像传感器提供相应的 "
"``refresh`` / ``resolution`` 控制。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:41
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:43
msgid ""
"Tuned the OV7725 AGC/AEC region (less motion blur), enabled the DSP solid "
"colorbar for the OV7725, and fixed IDE framebuffer streaming (no stale / "
"duplicate frames)."
msgstr ""
"调优了 OV7725 的 AGC/AEC 区域（减少运动模糊），为 OV7725 启用了 DSP 纯色彩条，并修复了 IDE "
"帧缓冲区流式传输（不再出现过时 / 重复帧）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:48
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "缺陷修复"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:50
msgid ""
"Fixed a DCMI/DMA transfer-size overflow in :func:`sensor.snapshot`, cleaned "
"up JPEG-compression buffer-overflow handling, improved the OV7725 AEC/AGC "
"operating region for better auto exposure/gain, and corrected the colorbar /"
" self-test scripts for the OV7725."
msgstr ""
"修复了 :func:`sensor.snapshot` 中的 DCMI/DMA 传输大小溢出问题，整理了 JPEG 压缩缓冲区溢出的处理逻辑，改进了 "
"OV7725 的 AEC/AGC 工作区域以获得更好的自动曝光 / 增益，并修正了 OV7725 的彩条 / 自检脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:56
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "硬件与开发板支持"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:58
msgid ""
"**OpenMV Cam M7 (STM32F7 / OPENMV7)** — initial board and bootloader "
"support."
msgstr "**OpenMV Cam M7（STM32F7 / OPENMV7）** —— 初步的开发板和引导加载程序支持。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:60
msgid "**OpenMV 2** — sensor clock driven by the MCO output."
msgstr "**OpenMV 2** —— 传感器时钟由 MCO 输出驱动。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:63
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "破坏性 API 变更"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:65
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v1.6.0 and v1.7.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"v1.6.0 与 v1.7.0 之间用户可见的 API 破坏性变更。范围：\\ ``modules/`` 中的 Python C 模块和 "
"``scripts/libraries/`` 中的 Python 库。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:68
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "每项变更都标注了其影响等级："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:70
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*minor* —— 影响范围窄的 API；仅影响使用过它的脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:71
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr "*behavior* —— API 不变，但结果不同；请重新检查经过调优的脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:73
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v1_7_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"变更按影响等级依次分组。如果你只想移植代码，可直接跳到末尾的 :ref:`迁移清单 <v1_7_0_migration>`\\ "
"。每个提交哈希都链接到其在 GitHub 上的差异。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:80
msgid ":func:`fir.init` is now keyword-only *(minor)*"
msgstr ":func:`fir.init` 现在仅接受关键字参数 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:82
msgid ""
":func:`fir.init` was reworked to take keyword arguments (``type=`` / "
"``refresh=`` / ``resolution=``, default ``refresh`` 64 Hz, max 512 Hz) "
"instead of positional arguments. Update positional ``fir.init(...)`` calls "
"to the keyword form."
msgstr ""
":func:`fir.init` 经过重构，改为接受关键字参数（\\ ``type=`` / ``refresh=`` / "
"``resolution=``\\ ，默认 ``refresh`` 为 64 Hz，最大 512 Hz），而非位置参数。请将位置参数形式的 "
"``fir.init(...)`` 调用更新为关键字形式。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:87
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `958c5b7f7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/958c5b7f7>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `958c5b7f7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/958c5b7f7>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:92
msgid "Oversized frames auto-crop to QVGA *(behavior)*"
msgstr "超大帧自动裁剪到 QVGA *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:94
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.snapshot` no longer raises when the raw frame exceeds the "
"board's maximum raw frame size — oversized raw frames are now "
"windowed/cropped to QVGA instead (only JPEG-mode raw is still rejected). "
"Choose a supported framesize if you relied on the previous error."
msgstr ""
"当原始帧超过开发板的最大原始帧尺寸时，\\ :func:`sensor.snapshot` 不再抛出异常——超大原始帧现在会被开窗 / 裁剪到 "
"QVGA（只有 JPEG 模式的原始帧仍会被拒绝）。如果你依赖之前的错误行为，请选择受支持的帧尺寸。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:99
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `b655a5488 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b655a5488>`__, `abace9e4f "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/abace9e4f>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `b655a5488 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b655a5488>`__\\ "
"、\\ `abace9e4f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/abace9e4f>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:105
msgid "OpenMV 2 max framesize lowered to QVGA *(behavior)*"
msgstr "OpenMV 2 的最大帧尺寸降至 QVGA *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:107
msgid ""
"On the OpenMV 2, the maximum integral-image / raw / blob framesize was "
"lowered from VGA to QVGA. Requesting VGA for grayscale / RGB565 / blob / "
"integral-image operations on the OpenMV 2 now crops to QVGA — redesign "
"scripts that depended on VGA processing on that board."
msgstr ""
"在 OpenMV 2 上，积分图像 / 原始 / 色块的最大帧尺寸已从 VGA 降至 QVGA。现在在 OpenMV 2 上对灰度 / RGB565 /"
" 色块 / 积分图像操作请求 VGA 时，会被裁剪到 QVGA——请重新设计依赖该开发板上 VGA 处理的脚本。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:112
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `7499062bd <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7499062bd>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `7499062bd <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7499062bd>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:117
msgid "Default JPEG quality reduced *(behavior)*"
msgstr "默认 JPEG 质量下调 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:119
msgid ""
"The default JPEG quality was reduced (default 50 → 35, with lower IDE "
"subsample thresholds) for more reliable streaming. Captured/streamed JPEGs "
"are visibly lower quality by default — pass an explicit ``quality`` to "
"``image.compress()`` if you need the previous quality."
msgstr ""
"默认 JPEG 质量已下调（默认值从 50 → 35，并降低了 IDE 的子采样阈值），以获得更可靠的流式传输。默认情况下，捕获 / 流式传输的 "
"JPEG 图像质量明显更低——如果需要之前的质量，请向 ``image.compress()`` 显式传入 ``quality``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:124
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `d9c8b1535 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d9c8b1535>`__"
msgstr ""
"*提交：* `d9c8b1535 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d9c8b1535>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:129
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "迁移清单"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:131
msgid "For a clean port to v1.7.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "要顺利移植到 v1.7.0，通常需要做的工作是："

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:133
msgid ""
"Convert positional ``fir.init(...)`` calls to the keyword form (:ref:`the "
"fir.init change <v1_7_0_fir>`)."
msgstr ""
"将位置参数形式的 ``fir.init(...)`` 调用转换为关键字形式（\\ :ref:`fir.init 变更 <v1_7_0_fir>`\\ "
"）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:135
msgid ""
"Use a supported framesize instead of relying on the old oversized-frame "
"error (:ref:`the oversized-frame change <v1_7_0_oversized>`), and redesign "
"VGA processing on the OpenMV 2 (:ref:`the OpenMV 2 framesize change "
"<v1_7_0_omv2framesize>`)."
msgstr ""
"使用受支持的帧尺寸，而非依赖旧的超大帧错误（\\ :ref:`超大帧变更 <v1_7_0_oversized>`\\ ），并重新设计 OpenMV 2 "
"上的 VGA 处理（\\ :ref:`OpenMV 2 帧尺寸变更 <v1_7_0_omv2framesize>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:139
msgid ""
"Pass an explicit ``quality`` to ``image.compress()`` if you need the "
"previous JPEG quality (:ref:`the JPEG-quality change <v1_7_0_jpeg>`)."
msgstr ""
"如果需要之前的 JPEG 质量，请向 ``image.compress()`` 显式传入 ``quality``\\ （\\ :ref:`JPEG "
"质量变更 <v1_7_0_jpeg>`\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.7.0.rst:142
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "其余所有脚本均可原样运行。"
